WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:11.650
Theaters are known for their ghosts.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:18.700
Take The Gooseberry. In 1919, Gideon
Gooseberry was a rising star on the Great

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:24.880
White Way. But on opening night, playing the
lovesick chimney sweep in Ashes to Ashes, a

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:32.370
300 pound sandbag came loose from the rafters and
brained him in the middle of his second act monologue.

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:33.120
Legend has it,

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:38.890
If you don't sweep Gideon's energy off the
stage every night, he'll find a way to curse

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:39.910
your show.

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:45.340
There was the cholera outbreak that tore
through the company of Hamlet in 1949.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:51.710
John Gielgud's crippling shingles attack during
the Iceman Cometh revival in '88. And now,

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:57.720
the death of Ben Glenroy.

00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:00.240
When you make the stage a part of your life,

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:01.260
it can be hard to escape

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:06.330
your personal ghosts too.

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:09.180
Your obsessions, your failures.

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:12.970
Just when you think you've broken free from
your old patterns.

00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:16.700
they come back to haunt you.

00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:20.930
I know President McKinley... Joy took
everything.

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:23.580
Except you and me.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.320
The guys with the attitude problems.

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:30.160
But we'll be fine.

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:32.410
We have each other.

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:38.240
But what do you do when your future starts
haunting you? The choices you'll never make.

00:01:38.270 --> 00:01:42.920
The lives you'll never lead. What's more
dangerous

00:01:43.710 --> 00:01:45.820
then someone whose dreams have died?

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:47.440
Howard? What's wrong?

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:50.970
I have something I need to confess.

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:52.320
I killed Ben Glenroy.

